[metadata]
Name:niche_stack_steam_kin
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your second main phase. You are at 20 life and control Runaway Steam-Kin with two +1/+1 counters on it and two untapped Mountains. Your hand is Blaze, Desperate Ritual, two Lightning Bolt, Gut Shot, Lava Dart, Manamorphose and Rite of Flame. Your library holds only Colossal Dreadmaw. The opponent is at 18 life and controls Grizzly Bears and two untapped Swamps, with no cards in hand. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-niche-stack-steam-kin | Steam-Kin's counter trigger has an intervening "if" (CR 603.4): a red spell cast while it has three counters does not trigger, and a trigger that resolves after others have taken it to three does nothing. Its counters are a mana ability, usable whenever you have priority and while a cost is being paid, before the spell becomes cast and triggers (CR 605.3a, 601.2g-i): so the counters must be spent before or during each cast at three counters, never left while the Mountains or floating mana pay. Gut Shot 1, Bolts 3 + 3, Lava Dart 1 + 1, Blaze for 9 = 18; paying with the Mountains first (the natural payment) reaches at most 17
