[solution]
# Gut Shot for life (2 -> 3 counters); cash before Manamorphose, which the Mountains could pay. Later casts at three
# counters find no other mana, so their payment spends the counters first and they still trigger. Blaze for 9; flashback.
cast Gut Shot
opponent
pay 1 Phyrexian
activate Runaway Steam-Kin
cast Manamorphose
